{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_20","type":"command_execution","command":"/opt/homebrew/bin/zsh -lc \"nl -ba docs/DECISIONS-log.md | sed -n '10991,11007p;11823,11900p'\"","aggregated_output":" 10991\t## D726 · 2026-11-22 · Alex opens a judge version for related number questions ($0 gate first) and agrees to \"Forecast unavailable\" as the first-release interim\n 10992\t\n 10993\t- **The questions** (after D725):\n 10994\t  - \"要不要开一个新的判官版本来试修法（相关的题合在一次里算，每个数字标明出处，程序检查算术和出处）？\" Options: 开，先做 0 元那一关\n 10995\t    (recommended: the format and checks designed and through the council, then the $0 gate on five stored cases, four gold controls and\n 10996\t    three planted errors; the paid gate asks Alex for its ceiling); 先不开.\n 10997\t  - \"第一版上线前的过渡：数字题只显示问题和来源，档位和预测文字写成'预测暂缺'，等通过检查再放出来。你同意这个做法吗？\" Options: 同意\n 10998\t    (recommended); 暂不定.\n 10999\t- **Alex's answers** (2026-11-22): \"开，先做 0 元那一关 (推荐)\"; \"同意 (推荐)\".\n 11000\t- **Decided (Alex):**\n 11001\t  - A new judge version is opened for the bounded test of D725: related number questions judged together, with labelled figures and\n 11002\t    code checks of identity and arithmetic. It is designed and reviewed at $0, then the $0 gate runs. The paid gate needs Alex's\n 11003\t    ceiling.\n 11004\t  - Until the number answers pass, a first release shows number questions with their sources and \"Forecast unavailable\": the band, the\n 11005\t    forecast text and its history withheld together. It is built with the release work, which is not started.\n 11006\t- poc-v118 stays the product.\n 11007\t\n 11823\t## D756 · 2026-11-23 · Alex closes the v13s line; the first release shows number questions as \"Forecast unavailable\"\n 11824\t\n 11825\t- **The question** (after D755): \"付费重发的结论是“停”：luna 在新格式下格式错误多（36 个首发里 22 个被拒），在说不清的题上还会硬给数；不过“两题合在一起算”确实避免了自相矛盾。数字题这条线下一步怎么走？\"\n 11826\t  - Options:\n 11827\t    - \"结束这条线，预测暂缺上线 (推荐)\": the council's consensus;\n 11828\t    - \"换更强的模型再小测一次\": a stronger model or higher effort, with a small paid probe and a cap Alex names;\n 11829\t    - \"先停，我想谈谈\".\n 11830\t- **Alex's answer** (2026-11-23): \"结束这条线，预测暂缺上线 (推荐)\".\n 11831\t- **Decided (Alex):**\n 11832\t  - The v13s judge line ends at its STOP. Nothing from it enters the product, and poc-v118 stays the product (D690).\n 11833\t  - The first release carries D726: number questions show the question and its sources with \"Forecast unavailable\", the band, the\n 11834\t    forecast text and the history withheld together.\n 11835\t  - The one next step, when release work opens, is a $0 check of the reader's screen on a stored number question that has a\n 11836\t    forecast and history: only the question, its sources and \"Forecast unavailable\" appear.\n 11837\t- **Kept for the record, not built:**\n 11838\t  - the D725 consistency finding (separate answers contradicted each other in 8 of 9 pairs, joint answers in none);\n 11839\t  - the open checker defects in `PAID-V13S-RESULT.md` §5;\n 11840\t  - the v13s request and harness in `docs/research/2026-11-22-number-answers/`.\n 11841\t\n 11842\t## D757 · 2026-11-23 · Toward production: the \"Forecast unavailable\" release design is ready for when Alex opens release work (council 72–72d); two choices go to Alex\n 11843\t\n 11844\t- **Why.** Alex's direction tonight was to converge and head toward production (D750), and he chose to release with \"Forecast\n 11845\t  unavailable\" (D756). D726 says it \"is built with the release work, which is not started\". Council 72 agreed that opening release\n 11846\t  work is Alex's call, so tonight's step is the design, not the build.\n 11847\t- **The gap, measured at $0** (`docs/research/2026-11-22-number-answers/FORECAST-UNAVAILABLE-DESIGN.md` §1):\n 11848\t  - today every reader of a number question can see its forecast: the service, the idea input, the closing text;\n 11849\t  - Yes/No and event explanations can quote number forecasts (`old-3/v36` judgement 799, `old-1/v10` judgement 865).\n 11850\t- **The design, after four review rounds** (`codex-r72.md` … `codex-r72d.md`):\n 11851\t  - one release exporter with an explicit allow-list, called directly by the release builder; the finished package is checked;\n 11852\t  - for a number question, the allow-list holds only the question, its sources and \"Forecast unavailable\";\n 11853\t  - the release reads nothing else: no live POC service, no translated or prepared JSON, no composite trials;\n 11854\t  - identity is structural: a question is a number question unless it is an event measure or a canonical Yes/No pair, and unresolved\n 11855\t    records are withheld and listed. Verified on four stores with no wrong result;\n 11856\t  - tests, mutants and an end-to-end acceptance on `old-1/v8` and the two known event leaks.\n 11857\t  - **Why an allow-list.** Rounds 72 and 72b each found new leak paths in a reader-by-reader design, so revision 3 replaced that\n 11858\t    approach with one structural rule.\n 11859\t- **Open for Alex:**\n 11860\t  1. whether to open release work now (then: build to this design, then the $0 release check);\n 11861\t  2. what questions that are not number questions show in the release:\n 11862\t     - (a) answer and label without explanation text, recommended by the council and Claude;\n 11863\t     - (b) explanations only where the judge was shown no number question's state: 21 of 85 questions at the latest answer, and it\n 11864\t       cannot guarantee that no number forecast is quoted.\n 11865\t- **Not done.** Nothing is built and nothing is committed. The POC is unchanged.\n 11866\t\n 11867\t## D758 · 2026-11-23 · Under D439 the council opens local release work for \"Forecast unavailable\"; non-number questions show no explanation text (§4 a); the v13s checker defects are closed as won't-fix (council 73)\n 11868\t\n 11869\t- **Why the council decides.** Alex is asleep and delegated tonight's decisions (D750: \"这边的决策交给你，还有 Council … 准备要往\n 11870\t  Production 方向去走了\"). He had already chosen the behaviour (D726 \"同意\"; D756 \"结束这条线，预测暂缺上线\"). D757 left two\n 11871\t  choices for him; under D439 a choice that would go to Alex goes to the council when it is reversible and within the limits.\n 11872\t- **Council round 73** (`docs/research/2026-11-22-number-answers/round73-brief.md`, `codex-r73.md`, `claude-r73.md`), consensus:\n 11873\t  1. **Release work opens tonight, local and at $0:** the exporter, the release builder, the package check, tests and mutants, the $0\n 11874\t     release check. Nothing committed, pushed, published or deployed; the POC and colleagues' page unchanged. Reversible: the package\n 11875\t     can be deleted without touching what the POC serves. D726's \"not started\" described the state on 2026-11-22 and set no gate.\n 11876\t  2. **§4 (a):** an event or Yes/No question shows its question, evidence and answer with its original label, and no generated\n 11877\t     explanation. It alone guarantees no number forecast reaches a reader through prose (option (b) cannot: a request carries the\n 11878\t     question's earlier reasoning, `views/judging.py:211`). The cost is real: readers lose the written rationale for those answers.\n 11879\t  3. **The v13s checker defects** (`PAID-V13S-RESULT.md` §5) are closed as won't-fix: `calc_small.py` has callers only in research\n 11880\t     code, the line is closed (D756), and the STOP bars tuning on the 36 answers. The findings stay on record.\n 11881\t  4. **Order:** the exporter and the checked package first; the reader's screen second (it completes D756's screen check). How the\n 11882\t     idea path enters the release is settled in the build design's review (round 74).\n 11883\t- **Still Alex's:** commit, push, publish, deploy, colleagues' POC page, any paid send or judge work.\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
